{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Trust</i> is a sci-fi first-person and top-down tactical shooter where players control Ingram, a combat-ready humanoid robot, and Bennett, an aerial drone, to uncover the mystery of an abandoned world. Switch seamlessly between action-packed gunfights and strategic reconnaissance while managing a shared energy system that fuels both ammo and self-repair. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Dual Perspective Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control Ingram in immersive first-person combat and exploration while switching to Bennett\u2019s top-down drone interface for reconnaissance and tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/dual-perspective_2.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drone Targeting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan, identify and select targets from Bennett's high vantage point to assist Ingram in high velocity combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/targeting.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Morph Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An advanced, shape-shifting firearm designed for Ingram, the <strong>Morph Weapon</strong> dynamically adapts to combat situations by transforming both its <strong>weapon type</strong> and <strong>ammo composition</strong> in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/morph-weapon-change.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kinetic Energy System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ingram's energy reserve is a singular resource for both ammunition and health, creating a high-risk, high-mobility combat loop. This Kinetic Energy System rewards aggressive movement, making every decision a trade-off between staying alive and staying armed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some Answers Cannot Be Erased</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The planet <strong>Helicopolis</strong> was abandoned long ago. Now, it is a graveyard of forgotten technology. When a  signal is detected from its surface, <i>The Trust, </i>a powerful governing galactic faction, sends two embodied AI to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ingram</strong>, a battle-ready humanoid combat unit, reluctantly follows orders. <strong>Bennett</strong>, an advanced aerial drone, sees the world through signals and data. Their mission is clear: find the source of the signal. But as they descend deeper into the wreckage of a lost world, they begin to question their directives, their creators, and themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Signal That Shouldn't Exist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Ingram and Bennett search for answers, they uncover something far more complex than a simple transmission. Their mission is compromised. Their programming is in question.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3283380?t=1742335272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/7c05ddc364fa29ab0932686be1252ed650234f72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742335272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/f7cf761fc6ab910fe2001cde120e4503f447b09d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742335272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/f7cf761fc6ab910fe2001cde120e4503f447b09d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742335272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Trust</i> is a sci-fi first-person and top-down tactical shooter where players control Ingram, a combat-ready humanoid robot, and Bennett, an aerial drone, to uncover the mystery of an abandoned world. Switch seamlessly between action-packed gunfights and strategic reconnaissance while managing a shared energy system that fuels both ammo and self-repair. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Dual Perspective Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control Ingram in immersive first-person combat and exploration while switching to Bennett\u2019s top-down drone interface for reconnaissance and tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/dual-perspective_2.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drone Targeting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan, identify and select targets from Bennett's high vantage point to assist Ingram in high velocity combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/targeting.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Morph Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An advanced, shape-shifting firearm designed for Ingram, the <strong>Morph Weapon</strong> dynamically adapts to combat situations by transforming both its <strong>weapon type</strong> and <strong>ammo composition</strong> in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/morph-weapon-change.gif?t=1742335272\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kinetic Energy System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ingram's energy reserve is a singular resource for both ammunition and health, creating a high-risk, high-mobility combat loop. This Kinetic Energy System rewards aggressive movement, making every decision a trade-off between staying alive and staying armed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some Answers Cannot Be Erased</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The planet <strong>Helicopolis</strong> was abandoned long ago. Now, it is a graveyard of forgotten technology. When a  signal is detected from its surface, <i>The Trust, </i>a powerful governing galactic faction, sends two embodied AI to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ingram</strong>, a battle-ready humanoid combat unit, reluctantly follows orders. <strong>Bennett</strong>, an advanced aerial drone, sees the world through signals and data. Their mission is clear: find the source of the signal. But as they descend deeper into the wreckage of a lost world, they begin to question their directives, their creators, and themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Signal That Shouldn't Exist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Ingram and Bennett search for answers, they uncover something far more complex than a simple transmission. Their mission is compromised. Their programming is in question.</p>","developers":["Fatalist Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/cc7e7994b5f805253f2757dd0d95e963013bed0a/header.jpg?t=1742335272","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114821,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114821/movie480.mp4?t=1742333054","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114821/movie_max.mp4?t=1742333054"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114821/523dc5